    {
      "id": "laboratory_enter",
      "event": "room_entered",
      "actions": [
        { "type": "showMessage", "lines": [
          "Banks of monitoring equipment line the ancient walls, their cables snaking into drill holes bored through carved stone. The Bulwark has turned this section of the Monument into a research facility.",
          "Screens display wind pattern analyses, atmospheric pressure readings, and spectral data from deep below. Whatever the Monument generates, the Bulwark is trying to understand it — and weaponize it.",
