        ]}
      ],
      "once": true
    },
    {
      "id": "wind_pattern_lore",
      "event": "room_entered",
      "conditions": [{ "not": { "hasFlag": "lab_wind_data_read" } }],
      "actions": [
        { "type": "setFlag", "flag": "lab_wind_data_read" },
        { "type": "showMessage", "lines": [
          "A monitor displays a three-dimensional model of wind currents flowing through the Monument. The patterns are impossibly complex — no natural formation could produce them.",
          "The wind doesn't just flow through the structure. The structure generates the wind, using geometry alone. The Bulwark researchers have annotated the model with a single word: 'Engineered.'"
        ]}
      ],
      "once": true
    },
    {
      "id": "control_panel_xp",
      "event": "door_interacted",
      "filter": { "tileName": "energy_conduit" },
      "conditions": [{ "not": { "hasFlag": "lab_panel_accessed" } }],
      "actions": [
        { "type": "setFlag", "flag": "lab_panel_accessed" },
        { "type": "showMessage", "lines": [
          "The energy conduit terminal responds to your sol unit. Data streams across the screen — the Bulwark's research notes on the Monument's wind generation systems.",
          "The findings are remarkable: the Monument's wind currents carry information, encoded in pressure differentials. The Bulwark couldn't decode it, but your sol unit recognizes fragments of the pattern."
        ]},
        { "type": "grantXp", "amount": 25 }
      ],
      "once": true
    }
  ]
